{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 166,
    "dDurationMs": 5034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran almost\nfired 35 missiles and 110 drones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5600,
    "dDurationMs": 3566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every day at its Gulf neighbors\nbefore the cease fire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9233,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's about $45 million per day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12700,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or $1.3 billion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16600,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "per month for a country\nwith only an estimated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19833,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "$11 billion in foreign exchange reserves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23733,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is a lot of money\nto burn through every month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27600,
    "dDurationMs": 4166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But given that oil prices went up\ninitially,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31933,
    "dDurationMs": 5433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran could easily afford it\nwith the increased oil revenue alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37866,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However,\nafter the US then counter blockaded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41400,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran, completely\nshutting down its oil exports,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45166,
    "dDurationMs": 4634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and after they launched\nthe so-called Operation Economic Fury"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50000,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "targeting Iran's money directly,\nthe Iranian riyal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53400,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "went into freefall compared to the dollar,\nwhich got worth a lot more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58033,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since then, Iranians have reported\nincreased shortages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61833,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and inflation\nrising ever higher and higher and higher,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65633,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "perhaps even soon,\ntowards hyper inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69266,
    "dDurationMs": 4134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that raises the question\nhow long can Iran actually afford"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73533,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to keep fighting before its war\neconomy collapses?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77266,
    "dDurationMs": 4034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, to answer that question properly,\nwe need to do a quick recap"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81300,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of War Economics 101 in a nutshell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84866,
    "dDurationMs": 5567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas civilian economies are all about\ngenerating wealth and spreading it widely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90766,
    "dDurationMs": 3434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "War economies are purely about mobilizing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94200,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as many resources as possible for war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97933,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if we look at the history of war\neconomies, there are three crucial lessons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101833,
    "dDurationMs": 5067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can help us answer if Iran can afford\nto keep fighting much longer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107133,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lesson number one comes from Russia,\nand it is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110400,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you have enough resources,\nyour limit is inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here we of course\nrefers to resources for war,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119800,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like fuel and food and manpower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124033,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether or not\nthey can be found inside the country"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128133,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or whether or not\nthey need to be imported."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130833,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is what really matters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132633,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If, like with Russia today,\nmost crucial resources"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136100,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are in fact inside the country itself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139333,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then, as we've seen with sanctions\nand other type of economic measures,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143466,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are unlikely to stop a country's war\neconomy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147066,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, while sanctions\ninitially crashed the Russian ruble,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150833,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was fairly easily stabilized\nwhen the Russians closed their economy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155833,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the outside world\nand focused on essentially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158966,
    "dDurationMs": 4767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "printing new money\nto activate Russia's unused resources."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163933,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And like we saw in a case like Russia work\nand then actually lead to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167566,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an economic boost at first,\nbut then when unemployment drops and more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172033,
    "dDurationMs": 4233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and more resources are activated,\nmore money printing then starts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176266,
    "dDurationMs": 6267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to lead to inflation, which is what really\nlimits the war economy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183900,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "War economy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184600,
    "dDurationMs": 3566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lesson number two comes from Germany,\nand it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188166,
    "dDurationMs": 4134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you depend on crucial resources\nfrom abroad, then your war"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192300,
    "dDurationMs": 5666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "economy can be hurt or even destroyed\nby economic warfare in two ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198366,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is through limiting access\nto foreign currency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202566,
    "dDurationMs": 5467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, for example, during the First World\nWar, Britain severely limited Germany's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208033,
    "dDurationMs": 5433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ability to import crucial war supplies\nfrom neutral countries"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213733,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through what was essentially\na financial blockade around Germany,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220100,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "punishing anyone who gave Germany access\nto pound sterling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224400,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, more famously, actually, Britain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227833,
    "dDurationMs": 6733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "did a massive naval blockade of Germany,\nwhich arguably led to the unexpected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234566,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collapse of the German government\nbecause it blocked vital"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238400,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "food imports into Germany,\ncausing a famine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242233,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "causing the people to rise up\nand overthrow the German Kaiser."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247366,
    "dDurationMs": 467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247833,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the third lesson comes again from Germany,\nbut now in the Second World War."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252000,
    "dDurationMs": 5433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is that if you can get air\nsupremacy, you can really crush"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257433,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a big part of the war economy directly,\nsimply by destroying factories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262366,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, for example, after Britain and the US"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265100,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bombed the German factories in the Ruhr\ncould beat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268533,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was essentially the end of the German\nair force, the Luftwaffe, meaning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272800,
    "dDurationMs": 4633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that countries like Britain and the Soviet\nUnion were much safer after that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277466,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how do these three lessons\nhelp us answer our main question?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281066,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether or not Iran's war\neconomy can afford to keep fighting?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284866,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While it means that we essentially need\nto determine whether or not Iran"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289366,
    "dDurationMs": 5034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is more like Russia today\nor like Germany in the two world wars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294566,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But first, it means that we need to assess\nthe physical damage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298466,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Iran physically\nkeep fighting after the bombardments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302466,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure. The answer is yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304033,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most credible reports that I found\nestimate that the US and Israel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307266,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have taken out about 60% of Iran's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310366,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drone and missile\nproduction and launching facilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313833,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The remaining missile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314833,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "launch facilities are underground\nand therefore very difficult to hit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318900,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And drone\nproduction will be even harder to destroy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322100,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Given that these are so simple to make\nthat they can be made"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325300,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decentralized in workshops,\nall over the country,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328466,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which will be impossible\nto take out completely from the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332700,
    "dDurationMs": 5066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On top of that, there are actually major\ndrone factories just north of Iran"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337766,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Russia, which already produce\nIranian designed drones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341766,
    "dDurationMs": 4334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and could and might already easily\nfind their way to Iran via"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346100,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Caspian Sea, which is of course,\nnot impacted by the US blockade."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350800,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with that out of the way, Israel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352733,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and more like Russia today\nor Germany in the world wars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356733,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, given\nthat Iran does not face a land invasion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360066,
    "dDurationMs": 3434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the resources that it needs to fight\nthis war are pretty simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363700,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just needs to produce enough drones\nand missiles to threaten its neighbors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367533,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, crucially, to threaten\nthe merchant ships that want to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371533,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go through the Strait of Hormuz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373800,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for that, it needs three main things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376900,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fuel, metals and workers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380666,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And essentially\nall of these are available inside Iran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384233,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact,\nunemployment is quite high and rising."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387833,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in theory, like Russia, Iran's\neconomy could even get a major boost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392233,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it switches to full war economy mode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395266,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, there are two problems\nwith that narrative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398166,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is that while in theory\na major oil and gas producer like Iran"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402166,
    "dDurationMs": 4034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should of course have enough fuel,\nbut in reality there are many reports"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406200,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from Iran\nthat this is in fact not the case"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409433,
    "dDurationMs": 4567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because refineries have been damaged\nand or mismanaged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414366,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similarly, while Iran has a lot of idle\nresources in general,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418100,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unemployment is very high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419400,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that should not be too much inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421733,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Reports from the country\nare that inflation is actually very high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426466,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's very strange right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427866,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On paper Iran is a lot like Russia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430700,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has so much unused potential."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433800,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But a war economics\none on one and only works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436233,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you have competent people\nrunning the economy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439166,
    "dDurationMs": 634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Russia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439800,
    "dDurationMs": 1466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That appears to be the case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441266,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in Iran, not so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443333,
    "dDurationMs": 967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's not all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444300,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a second problem,\nand that is that while Iran"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447066,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should be pretty self-sufficient,\nagain, in theory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450700,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it actually relies\nalmost completely on imports of microchips"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455800,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "needed to steer drones\nand missiles towards their targets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459333,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it almost completely relies on soybean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462766,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and corn imports to feed its livestock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466233,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And therefore the US\nblockade is now causing a potential"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470200,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so-called protein famine,\nnot a complete famine, because,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474233,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unlike Germany, Iran can produce enough\nwheat to feed its population."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478800,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But still, to be healthy,\npeople need to eat more than bread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481866,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, because Iran also relies on rice\nand cooking oil imports, the US"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486566,
    "dDurationMs": 6267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "blockade has still caused massive food\nand fuel price inflation in Iran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492900,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, in short, Iran's war\neconomy is a lot like Russia on paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496533,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because it is poorly managed, it\nactually still has a lot of common"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499866,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the German economy\nduring both world wars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503333,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meaning that a US blockade and operation\neconomic theory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507266,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can and actually are doing a lot of damage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511166,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by crashing the Iranian currency,\nmaking it much harder to import"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515366,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "crucial stuff needed for the war\nand to keep the population happy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519733,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But is it enough?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521333,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is the blockade stopping\nIran's war economy from functioning?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525533,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This question can be answered in two ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527966,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, will Iran have enough foreign\ncurrency reserves to keep importing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532233,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the microchips that it needs\nto power drones and missiles?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536533,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think there the answer is yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538766,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, while the collapsing\nIranian currency clearly shows us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542333,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the central bank has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543233,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a real foreign currency problem,\nwe have seen historically, for example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547066,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Germany,\nthat central bankers have many, many ways"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550466,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make foreign currency available for war\nby limiting civilian imports."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556033,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So even though the US blockade\nis absolutely contributing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560033,
    "dDurationMs": 4667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the collapse of the Iranian currency\nby blockading oil exports"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564700,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from Iran\nthat are difficult to export overland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568566,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fact that blocking the Strait\nof Hormuz and threatening neighbors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572566,
    "dDurationMs": 4567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with drones is so cheap probably means\nthat the blockade will not be enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577133,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to open the Strait of Hormuz,\nbut limiting civilian imports?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580566,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well,\nthat will be terrible for Iranian people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583733,
    "dDurationMs": 867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And given that the US"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584600,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is also blocking fairly crucial imports\nlike soybeans and corn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could the Iranian people rise up\nand overthrow the government,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592633,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like what happened in Germany\nin 1918?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596166,
    "dDurationMs": 4634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At first, this actually seems like\nan extremely plausible scenario."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601100,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After all, in January of this year,\nthere were already massive uprisings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605200,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as Iranians were unhappy with 40%\ninflation, which now already much higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610000,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with the shortages then,\nwhich are now already much more severe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613733,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, the 2026\nuprisings were brutally repressed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617100,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by Iran's Revolutionary Guard\nand their militias."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620000,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, most dictatorial regimes today\ndo not fail simply"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623933,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they can no longer afford\nto feed the public, like Germany in 1918."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628100,
    "dDurationMs": 4533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No. Now, if they fail, they do so\nbecause they can no longer afford to feed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632633,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or pay the men willing to shoot\nthe civilian protesters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636466,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, while there are now many reports\nthat the civilian economy in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640166,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran is really starting to hurt,\ninflation is going to pass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643966,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hyperinflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644800,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that's terrible, but it won't\nnecessarily cause the regime to collapse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649133,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Syria's regime\nlasted for more than ten years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652133,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after first facing hyperinflation in 2013."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655600,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Venezuela faced hyperinflation\nalso for years and years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659366,
    "dDurationMs": 3734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And technically,\nthat regime is also still in place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663266,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, in conclusion,\nthe American blockade and operation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666666,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "economic theory putting a lot of pressure\non the Iranian regime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669866,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, absolutely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671633,
    "dDurationMs": 1467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that hurting its firepower?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673100,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, absolutely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674633,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because drones are so cheap\nand because threatening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677466,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Strait of Hormuz is so cheap,\nIran's collapsing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681066,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "economy is probably not going\nto stop the war"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685200,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "directly, at least indirectly, though,\nthe blockade is really hurting the Iranian"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689700,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "economy, causing shortages and plausibly\neven causing hyperinflation soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694400,
    "dDurationMs": 4966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But perhaps unlike in 1980s Germany,\ndictatorships today do not collapse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699366,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the people are hungry,\nthey collapse when the guards are hungry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703500,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And from the evidence\nthat I've seen coming out of Iran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705966,
    "dDurationMs": 1067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things are pretty bad there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707033,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But its economy is still pretty far\nfrom that scenario."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710366,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how long can Iran afford\nto keep fighting for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713366,
    "dDurationMs": 1034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714400,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Probably at least in the current\nphase of the war, where Israel and the US"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718100,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are just threatening it from the air,\nnot with a full scale invasion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722500,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But yeah, these are my takes.\nWhat are yours?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725000,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me know in the comments below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727033,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you want to know more\nabout the pressure on the American economy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "due to this conflict, I highly recommend\nthat you check out some key"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734700,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "follow up articles from our advertising\nsponsor, The Economist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739200,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Specifically,\nif you are looking for a clear eyed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741600,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "assessment\non how Americans will suffer as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744800,
    "dDurationMs": 3966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd start with this article\non how the war has sent American inflation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749033,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sharply higher than to understand\nwhat's driving it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752533,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Read this extensive analysis on US\nfood price inflation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756600,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then this article\nabout how this all is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759433,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "contributing to Trump hitting his lowest\napproval ratings yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762900,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just as low as Biden's lowest point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765933,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, as these examples show,\nThe Economist delivers insights that help"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769500,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you see the bigger picture\nand think for yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772733,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why I almost always rely\non their analysis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775633,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for my research, and it is why\nI highly recommend that you subscribe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779400,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Given that they are now offering a 50%,\nwhich is temporary, so be quick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784800,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Discount for money and macro viewers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787566,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether you prefer daily journalism\nin the Economist app or you are like me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791266,
    "dDurationMs": 2034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and enjoy\ncatching up on the global economy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793300,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the weekend with a nice cup of coffee\nand the print edition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797900,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll always stay on top of the latest\nglobal developments and support journalism"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803100,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that values factual information, integrity\nand an independent point of view."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808666,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So do not miss out."
    } ]
  }, {
